# MCP Dev Tests

Test scripts for validating MCP tool chain.

## Structure

```
_dev_tests/
├── user_stories/     # Input user stories for testing
├── output/           # Generated code (gitignored)
├── test1.py          # First test scenario
├── test2.py          # Second test scenario
└── ...
```

## Usage

```bash
cd mcp_server/_dev_tests
python test1.py
```

## Naming Convention

- `test1.py`, `test2.py`, etc. - Simple numbered tests
- `output/` - Generated code goes here (gitignored)
